      "side": 1,
      "message": "In `RunIapProcess`, the ROM address is hardcoded twice using a magic number:\n\n```c\n  if (auto res \u003d SetRomAddress(0x0000); !res)\n\n```\n\n* **Recommendation:** Define a constant (e.g., `constexpr uint32_t kBaseRomAddress \u003d 0x0000;`) in `iap_control.h` or in the anonymous namespace, and use it in both the Read and Write phases.",
